  <ThingDef>
    <defName>YJZ_Thing_SwordRain</defName>
    <label>天剑雨</label>
    <description>“一气分而为阴阳，判而为天地。”

道书《剑阵篇》记载，紫府之后可将一念剑意分作满天白玉剑影。第一轮逼敌露隙，第二轮循着前一轮留下的灵机落下；看似万剑纷飞，实则皆出于一锋。

效果：由仙阵召出的两轮范围剑雨，结束后自行消散。</description>
    <thingClass>Yunjianzi.ThingYunjianziSwordRain</thingClass>
    <category>Ethereal</category>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <drawerType>None</drawerType>
    <altitudeLayer>Projectile</altitudeLayer>
    <selectable>false</selectable>
    <useHitPoints>false</useHitPoints>
    <destroyable>true</destroyable>
    <passability>Standable</passability>
    <pathCost>0</pathCost>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="BuildingBase" Name="YJZ_ArrayCoreBase" Abstract="True">
    <label>琉璃阵眼</label>
    <description>“八旗引紫电，一念镇周天。”

道书阵图特意让琉璃玉珠显形，使无形阵法留下一处可守、也可被敌人攻破的枢机。它并非仙阵最华丽之处，却承受着每一条阵纹回流的压力。

效果：仙阵的实体阵眼，会吸引附近敌人；阵眼被摧毁时，对应仙阵立即消散，其坚固程度随境界成长。</description>
    <thingClass>Yunjianzi.ThingYunjianziArrayCore</thingClass>
    <category>Building</category>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <drawerType>RealtimeOnly</drawerType>
    <altitudeLayer>Item</altitudeLayer>
    <selectable>true</selectable>
    <useHitPoints>true</useHitPoints>
    <destroyable>true</destroyable>
    <passability>Standable</passability>
    <fillPercent>0</fillPercent>
    <pathCost>0</pathCost>
    <rotatable>false</rotatable>
    <statBases>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
      <DeteriorationRate>0</DeteriorationRate>
    </statBases>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yunjianzi/Array/ArrayCore</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>0.9</drawSize>
      <color>(255,255,255)</color>
    </graphicData>
  </ThingDef>

